{"unit_id":"HeiBai-king__dsh-pet#card-zh","repo":"HeiBai-king/dsh-pet","commit":"2b135341a5ef72e850ed138e7f6b3c9e0d589aee","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-pet（DSH 插件，Windows 桌面与 Web 客户端）：把鲸鱼桌面球置于其他窗口上方，让你在 DSH 看不到的界面前直接求助。点击「截当前屏幕问会话」后，它截取当前屏幕并发送给你选定的 DSH 会话，回答显示在球上的气泡里；也可只发文字、按工作区选择会话，并拖动或缩放桌面球。适合需要边看其他应用、边请 DSH 提供操作指导的 Windows 用户。需要 Windows、PowerShell 和可用的 DSH；不需要额外 API Key。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:558-697","assets/pet-shot.ps1:36-50","assets/pet-ball.ps1:671-704"]}
{"unit_id":"HeiBai-king__dsh-pet#card-en","repo":"HeiBai-king/dsh-pet","commit":"2b135341a5ef72e850ed138e7f6b3c9e0d589aee","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-pet is a DSH plugin for Windows desktop and web. Its floating whale companion captures your screen and sends it with an optional note to a chosen session; replies appear in a bubble. It also supports text-only messages and workspace-based session selection. Requires Windows and PowerShell.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:558-697","assets/pet-shot.ps1:36-50","assets/pet-ball.ps1:671-704"]}
